S5L8947X: hook the platform and drivers into Kconfig and Makefiles

Wire the out-of-tree arch/arm/mach-apple machine, the j33iap device tree
and the S5L8940X / S5L8947X drivers copied in by apply-kernel-tree.py
into the kernel build. Every new symbol depends on ARCH_APPLE_S5L (or
COMPILE_TEST) and defaults to it, so other ARMv7 builds are unaffected.

NET_VENDOR_APPLE and the Apple SoC driver menu are opened up to
ARCH_APPLE_S5L so the Ethernet MAC and SGX driver can live next to the
existing Apple drivers.
